    <string name="capture_setup_title">Eight views, hands-free</string>
    <string name="capture_setup_steps">1. Stand the phone upright, at about chest height.\n2. Turn the volume up: I will talk you through it.\n3. Tap Start, walk back about three big steps, and face the phone.\n\nI take one photo of your front. Then you turn slowly all the way round, to your left, and I pick out seven more views as you go.</string>
